<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000C8E)
Some students started chatting about where they’d go after school.%NThose who were in clubs gathered with their fellow members and%Nheaded for their clubrooms. And the rest were just getting ready to go home ASAP.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000C9E)
I was in the last camp. As soon as the bell rang, I was always the%Nfirst to pack up and leave.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000CAE)
But today, I stayed glued to my seat, trying to avoid eye contact%Nwith any of my classmates. My anxiety was killing me.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000CBE)
After all, my date with Yua was very soon...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000CE6)
Any normal, non-
<DICT>
vidya
</DICT>
-obsessed person would’ve been%Nlosing their mind to have a date with a girl planned.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000CFE)
But this was *me* we were talking about, and I couldn’t feel any%Nmore depressed.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000D0E)
I couldn’t relax at all. I was feeling physically sick.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000D1E)
This would be the first time I’d ever gone on a date with a girl,%Nso I had no clue what to do.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000D2E)
Besides, would Yua even show up?
<LINE>
Maybe she’d just been fucking with me yesterday, and she planned on standing me up. She was probably watching from the shadows right%Nnow, giggling at how gullible I was.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000D3E)
Well, now that I thought about it, that honestly might be better%Nthan her actually showing up...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000D4E)
Wait, did I really have to just sit around waiting?%NI mean, I *could* just blow her off and go home.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000D5E)
All right, it’s settled—time to head home. We were in different%Ngrades anyway, so if I just canceled our date at the last minute, I’d never have to see her again for the rest of my life.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000D6E)
Fully determined to follow through with that plan, I stood up.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000E62)
【三住】
“Yo, Taku! You still here?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000E72)
Out of nowhere, my back fell victim to a hard slap.
<LINE>
I knew who was behind me without even looking.
<LINE>
The only guy in class who ever talked to me—none other than%NMisumi-kun.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000E82)
